# Layering

```text
Station.App -> Station.Workflow
Station.App -> Device.Hosting
Device.Hosting -> Client / Simulators / Drivers.* / Server / Contracts
```

- View: display/input only.
- ViewModel: call `IStationWorkflow`. No COM.
- Device wiring via `AddDevicePlatform` (`Simulator` | `Udl` | `Native`).
- Drivers: only place for UDL COM / native handles.
